{"seq":3,"slug":"glare-and-visual-comfort","title":"眩光与视觉舒适","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/glare-and-visual-comfort","wordCount":1373,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"眩光与视觉舒适\">眩光与视觉舒适</h1><p>照度全部达标的开放办公室，下午仍可能让人眯眼、转头、拉下百叶——因为视野里有一片刺眼的窗或灯。这就是眩光：不是光太少，而是光的分布失衡。前两篇解决了&quot;有没有光、够不够亮&quot;，本篇解决&quot;光给得对不对、晃不晃眼&quot;。眩光是光环境里最普遍的舒适缺陷，无论日光还是人工光都会引发，它是光环境从&quot;达标&quot;走向&quot;宜人&quot;的最后一跃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-眩光的成因与两种类型\">核心概念：眩光的成因与两种类型</h2><p>眩光的物理本质是<strong>视野内亮度对比过大</strong>。人眼能适应很宽的亮度范围，但无法同时适应相差悬殊的明暗——当一个高亮源出现在相对暗的背景里，它要么让人不适，要么直接看不清。按后果分两类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不舒适眩光（discomfort glare）</strong>：让人心烦、疲劳，但仍能看清作业。办公室对着窗、教室对着投影旁的灯，多属此类。它是长时间工作场所的主要矛盾。</li>\n<li><strong>失能眩光（disability glare）</strong>：在视网膜上形成散射光幕，直接降低对比、看不清目标。隧道口、夜间对向车灯是典型，关乎安全。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Source[高亮源&lt;br/&gt;窗/灯/反光面] --&gt; Eye((人眼视野))&#10;  Bg[较暗背景] --&gt; Eye&#10;  Eye --&gt;|亮度对比过大| G{眩光}&#10;  G --&gt;|尚能视物 但烦躁| Dis[不舒适眩光&lt;br/&gt;UGR/DGP]&#10;  G --&gt;|散射光幕 看不清| Dab[失能眩光&lt;br/&gt;影响安全]&#10;  Pos[光源位置 越近视线越严重] --&gt; G&#10;  Sol[光源亮度 越高越严重] --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  Source[高亮源&lt;br/&gt;窗/灯/反光面] --&gt; Eye((人眼视野))\n  Bg[较暗背景] --&gt; Eye\n  Eye --&gt;|亮度对比过大| G{眩光}\n  G --&gt;|尚能视物 但烦躁| Dis[不舒适眩光&lt;br/&gt;UGR/DGP]\n  G --&gt;|散射光幕 看不清| Dab[失能眩光&lt;br/&gt;影响安全]\n  Pos[光源位置 越近视线越严重] --&gt; G\n  Sol[光源亮度 越高越严重] --&gt; G</pre><p>决定眩光强弱的四要素：光源亮度（越高越眩）、光源在视野中的立体角（越大越眩）、光源相对视线的位置（越靠近视中心越眩）、背景亮度（越暗对比越大越眩）。这些要素被各类眩光指标用不同方式加权组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不舒适眩光的量化-ugr-与-dgp\">不舒适眩光的量化：UGR 与 DGP</h2><p>人工照明用<strong>统一眩光值 UGR（Unified Glare Rating）</strong> 评价，由 CIE 定义，把视野内各光源的亮度、立体角、位置指数和背景亮度综合成一个数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>0.25</mn><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UGR = 8\\log_{10}\\!\\left(\\frac{0.25}{L_b}\\sum_i \\frac{L_i^2\\,\\omega_i}{p_i^2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">GR</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9629em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是背景亮度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个光源的亮度、立体角与位置指数。UGR 越大越眩，通常办公要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UGR \\le 19</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">GR</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19</span></span></span></span></span>，绘图等精细作业 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UGR \\le 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">GR</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>。这是 <a href=\"artificial-lighting-design\">人工照明设计</a> 中&quot;亮度分布&quot;要求的量化落点——照明设计达标照度的同时，必须把 UGR 压在限值内。</p>\n<p>天然采光引起的眩光（窗眩光）则用<strong>日光眩光概率 DGP（Daylight Glare Probability）</strong> 评价，它给出&quot;有多大比例的人会觉得眩&quot;，与 <a href=\"daylighting-principles\">天然采光原理</a> 里的 ASE 指标互为表里——ASE 控过亮面积，DGP 评眩光感受。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>适用光源</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>典型限值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UGR</td>\n<td>人工照明</td>\n<td>0–30 评分</td>\n<td>办公 ≤19</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DGP</td>\n<td>天然采光/窗</td>\n<td>眩光概率</td>\n<td>可忽略 &lt;0.35</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亮度比</td>\n<td>通用快速判断</td>\n<td>比值</td>\n<td>作业:邻近 ≤3:1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视觉舒适-超越眩光的整体平衡\">视觉舒适：超越眩光的整体平衡</h2><p>不眩光只是底线，真正的视觉舒适还要求整个视野的亮度分布协调。核心是把亮度比控制在合理区间：作业面与邻近区域宜在 3:1 以内，作业面与较远背景宜在 10:1 以内。过大造成眩光与疲劳，过小则环境单调、缺乏立体感与生气。</p>\n<p>其他视觉舒适要素包括：<strong>频闪</strong>（劣质 LED 驱动导致光通量高频波动，引发头痛与视疲劳，优质灯具频闪深度需足够低）、<strong>阴影质量</strong>（过硬的阴影影响识别，过散则缺乏立体感）、<strong>光的方向性与造型立体感</strong>（博物馆、商品陈列尤其讲究）。这些与 <a href=\"artificial-lighting-design\">人工照明设计</a> 的显色、色温共同构成&quot;照明质量&quot;的完整图景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"眩光控制-从光源到界面\">眩光控制：从光源到界面</h2><p>控制眩光的手段沿&quot;光源—传播—接收&quot;链条展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>光源端</strong>：灯具加格栅、漫射罩、深防眩处理，降低出光面亮度并遮蔽大角度直射；窗户加内/外遮阳、百叶、电致变色玻璃。外遮阳同时削减太阳得热 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{sol}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与 <a href=\"building-energy-balance\">建筑能量平衡与能耗</a> 共享同一构件。</li>\n<li><strong>界面端</strong>：作业面避免镜面材料以防<strong>反射眩光（光幕反射）</strong>——光泽桌面、玻璃屏幕把灯具镜像反射进眼睛，是办公室隐形杀手；改用低光泽饰面、调整灯具与屏幕相对位置即可缓解。</li>\n<li><strong>背景端</strong>：适当提高背景与墙面亮度（浅色饰面、间接照明洗墙），缩小与光源的对比，从分母上削弱眩光。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>值得注意的是，眩光控制常与采光、节能冲突：放下遮阳挡眩光，就减少了日光、增加了人工照明能耗。因此现代做法是<strong>动态可调</strong>——可变遮阳与日光联动控制协同，在&quot;不眩、够亮、节能&quot;间逐时寻优，这套逻辑的模拟实现属于 <a href=\"../air-moisture-frontiers/performance-simulation-digital\">建筑性能模拟与数字化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>眩光的本质是视野内亮度对比过大，分为让人烦躁的不舒适眩光与看不清的失能眩光。</li>\n<li>眩光强弱取决于光源亮度、立体角、位置和背景亮度四要素。</li>\n<li>人工照明用 UGR 评价（办公 ≤19），天然采光用 DGP 评价，二者分别落点于照明篇与采光篇。</li>\n<li>视觉舒适超越眩光，还要求合理亮度比（作业:邻近 ≤3:1）、低频闪、恰当阴影与方向性。</li>\n<li>眩光控制沿光源、界面、背景三端展开，外遮阳与得热共享构件，反射眩光靠低光泽饰面缓解，最优解是动态可调。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"眩光与视觉舒适","id":"眩光与视觉舒适"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：眩光的成因与两种类型","id":"核心概念-眩光的成因与两种类型"},{"level":2,"text":"不舒适眩光的量化：UGR 与 DGP","id":"不舒适眩光的量化-ugr-与-dgp"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉舒适：超越眩光的整体平衡","id":"视觉舒适-超越眩光的整体平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"眩光控制：从光源到界面","id":"眩光控制-从光源到界面"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人工照明设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/artificial-lighting-design"},"next":{"title":"室内声学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/room-acoustics-fundamentals"}}